{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":59,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["因罪與主隔絕"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["看啊，耶和華的臂膀並非無力拯救，",{"text":"祂的耳朵並非聾得聽不見。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而是你們的罪過使你們與上帝隔絕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的罪惡使祂轉臉不看你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不聽你們的祈求。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的手染滿了血污，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"手指沾滿了罪惡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的嘴唇吐出謊言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"舌頭嘀咕惡事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人按公義訴訟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人憑誠實申辯。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們全憑虛言，謊話連篇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心懷惡意，生出罪惡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們孵毒蛇蛋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人吃了這蛋必死，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蛋打破後爬出毒蛇。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們編蜘蛛網，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這網不能做衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們無法用所製作的遮蓋自己。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們行為邪惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"做事殘暴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的腳奔向邪惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"急於濫殺無辜；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們心懷惡念，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所到之處，大肆毀滅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們不知道平安之路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的行徑毫無公正；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們走歪門邪道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"跟從你們的必不知何為平安。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，正義遠離我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公義臨不到我們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們渴望光明，卻得到黑暗；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們渴望曙光，卻仍然走在幽暗中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們像盲人一樣沿牆摸索，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像無眼睛的人一樣探路。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們在中午也跌跌撞撞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同走在晚上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們在強壯人當中如同死人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們都像熊一樣咆哮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如鴿子一般哀鳴。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們渴望正義，卻得不到；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"渴望得到拯救，卻遙不可及。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我們在上帝面前過犯纍纍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們的罪惡向我們發出控訴。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們被過犯纏身，自知有罪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們悖逆，否認耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"離棄我們的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說欺壓、叛逆的話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吐露心中編織的謊言。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正義被趕逐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公義遠遠站立，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"真理倒在街上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正直被拒之門外。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"真理無處可尋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遠離惡事的人反成了獵物。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華見正義蕩然無存，感到不悅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂因無人、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無一個人主持公道而驚訝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就用自己的臂膀施行拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用自己的公義維繫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂以公義作鎧甲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以救恩作頭盔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以復仇作衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以熱忱作外袍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必按各人的行為報應各人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向祂的敵人發烈怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"報復祂的仇敵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向眾海島施行報應。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣，日落之處的人必敬畏耶和華的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"日出之地的人必對祂的榮耀肅然起敬。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必如耶和華之氣推動的急流一樣奔來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：「必有一位救贖主來到錫安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到雅各那些離棄罪惡的子孫那裡。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["耶和華說：「這是我與他們所立的約：我賜給他們的靈和我放在他們口中的話，必不離開他們和他們的子子孫孫，從現在直到永遠。這是耶和華說的。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/59.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/60.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/58.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}